# Safe edit order

1. Establish repro or failing test
2. Apply smallest proven fix
3. Verify repro passes
4. Run targeted regression checks
5. **Callee redirect cleanup** — if the fix changed call targets, grep old symbols; remove when zero refs remain ([`callee-redirect-cleanup.mdc`](./callee-redirect-cleanup.mdc))
6. Only then optional wider cleanup (separate patch)

Do not reorder to "clean up first" during incident fixes.
